thinking-orbs
-------------
This package includes a terminal port of the dotted thought-orb animation
engine from https://github.com/Jakubantalik/thinking-orbs
(https://orbs.jakubantalik.com), Copyright (c) 2026 Jakub Antalik.

The React/canvas component is not vendored; only the pure animation math is
adapted for Pi's TUI and rendered as two-cell Braille.

